  "description": "Fingerprint-aware TLS reverse proxy. Use Finch to outsmart bad traffic—collect client fingerprints (JA3, JA4 +QUIC, JA4H, HTTP/2) and act on them: block, reroute, tarpit, or deceive in real time.",
